<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2993"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, December 29, 2004 - 2:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;located at Kechi&#34;  <BR> <BR>What&#39;s that mean? Is that an address and why does it show up where it does on the map? <BR>Hmmm... <BR> <BR>Strange. <BR> <BR>Maybe it&#39;s a front for the Feds...?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
